Routine for representing the point estimates of local projections as a cumulating weighted average over time Use lpdecomp With STATA 19
----------------------

 ^lpdecomp^
 
Description
-----------

^lpdecomp^ Routine for representing the point estimates of local projections as a cumulating weighted average over time Use lpdecomp With STATA 19
     
^Note:^ Requires lpdecomp.ado by Olah Data Semarang

Examples
--------

 . ^qtsset tsset^
 . ^lpdecomp lpdecomp lpdecomp_ `mount', h(24) lag(11) contemp(contemp) cum noadj decompgraph^

